  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t25_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Spring physics with state\n\nA position chases the mouse with Hooke + damping. Two state slots (vec2): position and velocity. Each frame, with vec2 maths:\n  • vel ← vel · damp + (mouse − pos) · k\n  • pos ← pos + vel\nThe two Scale nodes hold k (0.05) and damp (0.85).\n\nWrite/Read are used twice — one for pos, one for vel.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Spring physics with state\n\nA position chases the mouse with Hooke + damping. Two state slots (vec2): position and velocity. Each frame, with vec2 maths:\n  • vel ← vel · damp + (mouse − pos) · k\n  • pos ← pos + vel\nThe two Scale nodes hold k (0.05) and damp (0.85).\n\nWrite/Read are used twice — one for pos, one for vel.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
